"E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_TWO"],"2 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjYo7q87NGWAxX9c_UHHWE7BFoQ3YcHCFMoAQ"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwjYo7q87NGWAxX9c_UHHWE7BFoQ3IcHCFEoEg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["2025.07.25～27\n\n連續3天午餐都吃這家。位置不多。環境乾淨。內用可自取水。\n\n紅火火 超過癮麻辣拉麵：辣度吃起來算小辣，我是平常吃中辣的人。我選擇粗麵，麵條硬度吃起來感覺是中等偏硬。拉麵配料有花椰菜、筍絲、玉米筍，比一般的拉麵更多蔬菜（但也沒有多到可以滿足一天所需的那種）。溏心蛋有點過熟但還是很好吃。湯頭濃郁。\n\n辣麼香 川味炙燒牛拉麵：我選擇細麵偏硬的，很不錯。我覺得牛肉吃起來比麻辣麵的豬叉燒來得好吃、味道豐富，但感覺也比較油就是了。湯頭濃郁。\n\n櫻花煎茶、桂花煎茶：香香的，微甜，都很讚。\n\n繽紛野莓果茶：我覺得蠻酸的，喜歡很酸的人可以點。\n\n其他還有點過胡麻嫩豆腐、胡麻龍鬚涼菜，還有一次是胡麻花椰菜（好像臨時店家食材不足），都很好吃不會踩雷～",null,[0,43]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/343726333116173694/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBHYzA1WFVuVlpNVlpKWVRKemRGbHJlRmxaVm1oUFRGZHNObVJHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/343726333116173694/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBHYzA1WFVuVlpNVlpKWVRKemRGbHJlRmxaVm1oUFRGZHNObVJHUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/343726333116173694/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBHYzA1WFVuVlpNVlpKWVRKemRGbHJlRmxaVm1oUFRGZHNObVJHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/343726333116173694/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBHYzA1WFVuVlpNVlpKWVRKemRGbHJlRmxaVm1oUFRGZHNObVJHUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/343726333116173694/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBHYzA1WFVuVlpNVlpKWVRKemRGbHJlRmxaVm1oUFRGZHNObVJHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/343726333116173694/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBHYzA1WFVuVlpNVlpKWVRKemRGbHJlRmxaVm1oUFRGZHNObVJHUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,4200,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pGc05XUnVZMVZJYTJzdFlreFlZVmhPTFdsNmRGRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x9b38d54fc2d58f26!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjFsNWRuY1VIa2stYkxYY